cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AXIS in your work, please cite it using the metadata below. No academic paper has been published for this project yet; cite the software/repository directly."
type: software
title: "AXIS: Architectural eXpert Intelligence System"
abstract: >-
  AXIS is an open-source research project developing specialized artificial
  intelligence for spatial, geometric, and architectural reasoning, including
  2D floorplan reading, 3D BIM/IFC understanding, and normative clearance
  compliance checking. AXIS is the public continuation of research previously
  conducted under the internal codename ARCHI-AI.
authors:
  - name: "EncoreZaan"
    email: "teobarreau7@gmail.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/EncoreZaan/AXIS"
url: "https://github.com/EncoreZaan/AXIS"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-21"
keywords:
  - architecture
  - spatial-reasoning
  - geometric-deep-learning
  - bim
  - ifc
  - floorplan-analysis
  - computational-design
  - artificial-intelligence
